WEBVTT

00:00.140 --> 00:01.640
We've made it easier to keep track

00:01.640 --> 00:04.000
of conversations inside of Basecamp.

00:04.000 --> 00:05.860
Now you can reply to someone's comment

00:05.860 --> 00:07.560
or even a portion of their comment,

00:07.560 --> 00:11.301
so it's very clear exactly
what you're responding to.

00:11.301 --> 00:13.861
Let me show you how it
works. So on this to-do,

00:13.861 --> 00:17.202
I have several comments, a
couple of unanswered questions.

00:17.202 --> 00:20.022
Now, if I were to jump
in and say "Absolutely!"

00:20.022 --> 00:21.562
or "Absolutely not!"

00:21.562 --> 00:24.522
it wouldn't be clear if I
was talking about the buffet

00:24.522 --> 00:29.043
or plated, the vegan
entree, or skipping dessert.

00:29.043 --> 00:30.603
Now I can respond

00:30.603 --> 00:32.643
and highlight exactly the portion

00:32.643 --> 00:34.944
of the conversation I want to comment on.

00:34.944 --> 00:37.604
So let's go here. I can
mouse over this area

00:37.604 --> 00:39.384
and a reply button comes up.

00:39.384 --> 00:41.544
And then when I respond, it's clear

00:41.544 --> 00:44.985
that I'm responding exactly to this item.

00:44.985 --> 00:46.925
Now, you can also highlight just a

00:46.925 --> 00:48.585
portion of the conversation.

00:48.585 --> 00:50.745
So let's go up here. Let's
say I want to respond

00:50.745 --> 00:52.406
to this buffet or plated.

00:52.406 --> 00:55.026
I can highlight it, hit that reply button,

00:55.026 --> 00:59.206
and then just that
section of text is shown.

00:59.206 --> 01:03.027
Then I can respond and it is
very clear that I am responding

01:03.027 --> 01:04.607
to just that portion of the comment.

01:07.467 --> 01:11.468
Now, this new update also
works in chats and pings.

01:11.468 --> 01:14.548
So let me go into this chat conversation.

01:14.548 --> 01:18.169
And you've always been able
to mouse over a chat, hit

01:18.169 --> 01:20.069
that three dot menu and reply,

01:20.069 --> 01:21.869
and you would see that text quoted.

01:21.869 --> 01:25.030
Now you can do that for just
a portion of the text as well.

01:25.030 --> 01:27.150
So let me highlight this.

01:27.150 --> 01:28.430
If I hit that three dot menu

01:28.430 --> 01:32.050
and reply, just that section
is going to be quoted

01:32.050 --> 01:34.051
and then I can comment directly.

01:34.971 --> 01:37.071
Let's see, isn't it the 26th?

01:39.931 --> 01:42.332
With this new update, it's very clear

01:42.332 --> 01:45.192
what you're commenting on,
especially on longer threads

01:45.192 --> 01:48.112
where there's lots of conversation
happening back and forth.

01:48.112 --> 01:50.032
This update makes it really easy

01:50.032 --> 01:52.033
to keep up with all the comments.

01:52.033 --> 01:52.866
I hope it helps.
